      "id": "premise-2",
      "area": "concurrency",
      "premise": "In updateAddrs, ac.mu is now still held (handed to the spawned goroutine) when the deferred ac.transport.GracefulClose() runs; GracefulClose synchronously calls onClose which locks ac.mu. This cannot deadlock, because the spawned goroutine unlocks ac.mu without depending on updateAddrs returning (updateConnectivityState only schedules on the balancer serializer), so the deferred call only waits briefly.",
