        {"coordinate": "internal/transport/http2_client.go:1055", "text": "t.onClose(GoAwayInvalid)"},
        {"coordinate": "clientconn.go:1351", "text": "onClose := func(r transport.GoAwayReason) { ac.mu.Lock()"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "premise-3",
      "area": "concurrency",
      "premise": "With the change, after connect() observes state==Idle under ac.mu, the state is set to Connecting before ac.mu is released (or ac.ctx is already cancelled and the addrConn is being torn down), so a second concurrent connect() cannot also observe Idle and start a parallel tryAllAddrs; and the updateAddrs path cannot leave two live connection attempts on the same non-cancelled ac.ctx.",
